  "notes": "{夢見|ゆめみ}る is a compound verb from {夢|ゆめ} (dream) and {見|み}る (to see). It conjugates as an ichidan verb.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {夢見|ゆめみ}ている means 'is dreaming of' (ongoing aspiration) or 'is having a dream' (during sleep)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {夢|ゆめ}を{見|み}る: to have a dream (more common for literal sleep dreams)\n- {夢見|ゆめみ}る: literary/aspirational nuance, often used for hopes and ideals",
